WEBVTT

00:00:07.110 --> 00:00:08.230
It's here.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:13.860
It's here.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:16.880
It's finally here!

00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:19.410
I won't be an Ojamajo anymore!

00:01:50.040 --> 00:01:54.920
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:01:54.920 --> 00:01:57.800
Tailless taiyaki, appear!

00:02:03.610 --> 00:02:04.220
Next!

00:02:05.090 --> 00:02:09.710
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:02:09.710 --> 00:02:12.800
A shortcake without the strawberry, appear!

00:02:19.630 --> 00:02:20.910
Not bad.

00:02:20.910 --> 00:02:25.080
Wow! Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan, you're doing great.

00:02:25.080 --> 00:02:26.370
They are!

00:02:26.370 --> 00:02:29.120
Doremi, you should practice too!

00:02:29.120 --> 00:02:32.040
The level 9 witch exam is this Sunday!

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:35.630
Then we go on to level 8 and level 7.

00:02:36.990 --> 00:02:42.720
Ghosts don't have any exams, so why do witches have them?

00:02:49.220 --> 00:02:51.410
Aim for Level 9! The Witch Exam.

00:02:54.400 --> 00:02:57.570
Listen up! We're going to the Witch World for the exam.

00:02:58.270 --> 00:02:59.780
We can go to the Witch World?

00:02:59.780 --> 00:03:02.500
We're not going there for a picnic!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:05.540
We will meet the examiner there.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:08.790
If you can meet her requirements with magic, you'll pass.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.170
It's a shame that we have to be tested.

00:03:11.170 --> 00:03:15.040
If you stay as an Ojamajo, it won't do me any good.

00:03:15.040 --> 00:03:18.510
But this is our first witch exam.

00:03:18.510 --> 00:03:22.090
Of course! Normal people don't hafta to take these exams.

00:03:22.090 --> 00:03:27.100
Does making strange food really help?

00:03:27.600 --> 00:03:29.600
It'll help you if you follow my directions!

00:03:29.600 --> 00:03:30.940
Stop jabbering and start practicing.

00:03:30.940 --> 00:03:33.900
I'll practice now, so please give me some magic spheres.

00:03:33.900 --> 00:03:35.650
You little...

00:03:38.050 --> 00:03:42.320
I don't really care about those two. It's you I'm worried about.

00:03:42.320 --> 00:03:46.830
The only way for me to go back to my former self is through Doremi.

00:03:46.830 --> 00:03:51.370
Right, right! If your student fails, it'd be embarrassing for you, Majo Rika.

00:03:51.370 --> 00:03:54.230
Failing the level 9 exam is really rare!

00:03:54.230 --> 00:03:56.420
Eh? So it's easy?

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:58.960
Then, it's okay even if we don't practice?

00:03:59.960 --> 00:04:02.220
You're the only one I'm worried about.

00:04:02.220 --> 00:04:05.850
I have no choice. I'll give the magic spheres just to you.

00:04:06.160 --> 00:04:07.720
Lucky!

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:09.310
Please.

00:04:11.090 --> 00:04:12.850
Fine...

00:04:13.680 --> 00:04:17.520
Those are the last ones in the shop. Use them carefully.

00:04:17.520 --> 00:04:22.320
Remember to save some magic spheres for the exam.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:23.820
Yes, ma'am.

00:04:24.360 --> 00:04:28.740
If you pass, you'll get your own fairies.

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:31.660
I hope my fairy is as lovely as you, Lala.

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:33.580
What kinda fairy will I get?

00:04:33.580 --> 00:04:35.620
I'm excited about it too.

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:38.170
I want to show her how to make some magic goods.

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:41.590
All you think about is doing things the easy way.

00:04:41.590 --> 00:04:44.840
How can you pass the exam like this?

00:04:44.840 --> 00:04:46.680
Don't you worry.

00:04:46.680 --> 00:04:48.640
Piece of cake! Piece of cake!

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.010
30 points...

00:04:52.810 --> 00:04:56.250
Well, math has nothing to do with the witch exam.

00:04:56.250 --> 00:04:58.600
No problem! The exam is easy...

00:04:58.600 --> 00:04:59.310
Doremi!
No problem! The exam is easy...

00:04:59.310 --> 00:05:00.230
Doremi!

00:05:00.230 --> 00:05:03.190
With 30 points, what's so easy about it?

00:05:03.190 --> 00:05:03.940
Pop!

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.700
I have to remember not to become a bad student like you.

00:05:08.240 --> 00:05:12.090
Why does my own sister have to go that far?

00:05:12.090 --> 00:05:15.320
I'm really the world's unluckiest pretty girl...

00:05:17.170 --> 00:05:19.580
Alright, alright. Out of my way! Out of my way!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:25.050
Fine!

00:05:25.050 --> 00:05:28.930
Let's eat something before practicing for the witch exam.

00:05:31.070 --> 00:05:34.180
Doremi, recyclables go here!

00:05:34.180 --> 00:05:37.930
You have to separate the recyclables from the non-recyclables!

00:05:37.930 --> 00:05:38.810
Furthermore...

00:05:38.810 --> 00:05:40.150
What?

00:05:40.150 --> 00:05:42.770
Don't eat snacks before dinner!

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:44.320
Like Pop said.

00:05:44.320 --> 00:05:47.570
I don't know what to do with you, Doremi!

00:05:51.270 --> 00:05:56.040
Doremi, you were like that too, always imitating what I do.

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:59.460
You always wanted to grow up so quickly.

00:06:12.530 --> 00:06:15.830
I want to become a real witch as soon as possible.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:17.940
Not an Ojamajo.

00:06:20.230 --> 00:06:22.900
Ooh, this is so cool!

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:26.150
When will you stop posing as a poor witch, Doremi?

00:06:30.290 --> 00:06:31.740
Noooo!

00:06:32.530 --> 00:06:36.790
After all that imagining, I'm getting sleepy.

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:39.870
That's enough for today.

00:06:43.280 --> 00:06:47.210
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto...

00:06:47.210 --> 00:06:48.590
Ah! No!

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:52.340
I'm not a poor witch...

00:06:55.690 --> 00:06:58.140
Tonight's the witch exam.

00:06:58.140 --> 00:07:03.410
I have plenty of magic spheres, so I'll go to the Maho-dou and practice!

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:05.480
Mom, I'm going out!

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:07.610
Are you really going to be okay?

00:07:07.610 --> 00:07:08.960
I'll be fine, I'll be fine.

00:07:08.960 --> 00:07:12.160
I've been to Grandma's many times.

00:07:12.160 --> 00:07:14.320
You're taking the train, you know.

00:07:14.320 --> 00:07:16.120
That's no problem!

00:07:16.120 --> 00:07:17.580
What's the matter?

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:22.500
Pop said she wants to go to Grandma's alone.

00:07:23.040 --> 00:07:25.540
Doremi, would you go with her?

00:07:26.660 --> 00:07:28.970
I-I have an important thing to do today.

00:07:28.970 --> 00:07:32.970
I'll be fine. Doremi will only get in my way.

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:34.800
Well, excuse me.

00:07:34.800 --> 00:07:38.430
I see. Okay, Pop, you can go alone.

00:07:38.430 --> 00:07:38.960
Sure.

00:07:38.960 --> 00:07:41.810
Here's some dried fish I made from the fish your father caught.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:45.480
Don't forget to buy the daifuku that grandma loves on the way!

00:07:45.480 --> 00:07:48.070
Get the box of ten for 1000 yen, okay?

00:07:48.070 --> 00:07:52.240
Then you get on the train and get off at the third station.

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.030
From there walk straight to grandma's house.

00:07:54.030 --> 00:07:55.240
I know.

00:07:56.150 --> 00:07:59.040
The money for the manjuu and the ticket is inside.

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.430
Do you need the "I'm lost" sign?

00:08:02.430 --> 00:08:04.420
It looks so uncool. I don't need it.

00:08:04.420 --> 00:08:05.670
I'm off.

00:08:06.040 --> 00:08:07.380
Be careful on the road.

00:08:07.380 --> 00:08:08.300
Okay!

00:08:08.720 --> 00:08:11.990
Doremi, I'm sorry, but could you follow Pop?

00:08:11.990 --> 00:08:14.300
Secretly, so she won't find out.

00:08:15.670 --> 00:08:17.810
Please.

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:21.850
This is Pop's first time traveling by train.

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:27.150
I guess I have no choice.

00:08:41.190 --> 00:08:43.620
Pretty Witchy Doremi-chi!

00:08:47.070 --> 00:08:47.750
Ah! Found her!

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:53.880
Wasn't that Doremi's voice just now?

00:08:53.880 --> 00:08:56.510
Jeez, why can't I fly properly?

00:08:57.300 --> 00:08:58.100
Oh no!

00:09:08.210 --> 00:09:12.070
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:09:12.070 --> 00:09:13.900
Become Ai-chan!

00:09:18.200 --> 00:09:21.370
Ah, I didn't think I'd run into ya here, Pop-chan!

00:09:22.080 --> 00:09:23.040
W-Who are you?

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.040
Oh darnit! Pop doesn't know Ai-chan.

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:31.050
Err, I'm Doremi-chan's friend. The name's Aiko.

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:34.630
Doremi-chan showed me a picture of your family.

00:09:35.920 --> 00:09:40.390
Very well, thanks for putting up with my incompetent sister.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:42.310
Incompetent sister, huh?

00:09:42.310 --> 00:09:46.100
I'd like to chat, but I have to go.

00:09:46.100 --> 00:09:47.710
Excuse me.

00:09:47.710 --> 00:09:52.150
That Pop! She just cost me a magic sphere.

00:09:52.930 --> 00:09:55.400
I still can't fly the broom well.

00:09:58.110 --> 00:10:01.200
I guess I'll follow her on foot.

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:02.750
Doremi-chan, right?

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.450
Ai-chan, Hadzuki-chan!

00:10:04.450 --> 00:10:06.040
Whatcha doin'?

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.580
It's my sister's first trip alone. So I gotta protect her.

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:11.880
But you're amazing! You look exactly like Ai-chan!

00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:14.420
Then the exam should be a piece of cake!

00:10:14.420 --> 00:10:18.590
By the way, would ya lay off of changin' into me?

00:10:18.590 --> 00:10:20.430
Ah, I'm super-duper sorry 'bout dat!

00:10:20.430 --> 00:10:22.300
Okay, yer Kansai dialect ain't so hot.

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.680
Ah! I changed back.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:27.690
Ah! Pop!

00:10:27.690 --> 00:10:29.270
Oh no!

00:10:29.270 --> 00:10:30.340
I have to find her now!

00:10:30.340 --> 00:10:32.690
Doremi-chan, what about the Maho-dou?

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.110
I'll leave it to you two.

00:10:34.110 --> 00:10:37.070
Don't forget that ya still hafta practice!

00:10:37.070 --> 00:10:40.030
Just as I expected from a Naniwa girl's personality! She always remembers.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:43.780
Wait up Mr. Butterfly!

00:10:43.780 --> 00:10:45.950
Eh? Where am I?

00:10:46.990 --> 00:10:47.700
Found her!

00:10:49.870 --> 00:10:51.810
So she's lost.

00:10:51.810 --> 00:10:54.920
There's no manjuu shop around here.

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:13.570
What should I do?

00:11:13.570 --> 00:11:14.400
Of course!

00:11:15.720 --> 00:11:18.910
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:21.400
How's this!?

00:11:22.650 --> 00:11:24.070
Wait, pretty boy!

00:11:24.070 --> 00:11:25.080
Pretty boy?

00:11:25.080 --> 00:11:28.040
Could you take me to a manjuu shop?

00:11:28.040 --> 00:11:30.210
What was that all about?

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:34.330
Jeez! She just cost me another magic sphere.

00:12:00.980 --> 00:12:01.820
Thank you.

00:12:06.780 --> 00:12:09.510
Why am I sneaking?

00:12:09.510 --> 00:12:13.060
Maybe if I change into a dog or a cat, I can follow her more easily.

00:12:13.060 --> 00:12:15.130
That's right! I'm a witch after all!

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:16.590
Yay, I found the daifuku!

00:12:16.590 --> 00:12:20.550
No, I can't waste any more magic spheres on Pop.

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:25.680
1200 yen!?

00:12:25.680 --> 00:12:28.380
Mom said it was 1000 yen.

00:12:28.380 --> 00:12:32.390
I'm sorry, the price just went up this month.

00:12:34.570 --> 00:12:36.270
I won't have enough money for the train.

00:12:36.270 --> 00:12:38.380
She doesn't have enough money.

00:12:38.380 --> 00:12:41.860
Jeez, Mom! Why didn't you give her extra money?

00:12:46.730 --> 00:12:49.660
Fine. I'll give my allowance to Pop.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:54.620
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:58.090
Move two 100-yen coins to Pop's purse.

00:13:02.510 --> 00:13:06.970
You know, Miss, you're looking very pretty today.

00:13:07.960 --> 00:13:10.220
Your face is white like the daifuku.

00:13:10.220 --> 00:13:12.310
Your cheeks look like sakuramochi.

00:13:12.310 --> 00:13:14.310
Oh, really?

00:13:14.310 --> 00:13:18.230
So, would you sell me the daifuku for 1000 yen?

00:13:19.020 --> 00:13:21.480
She's haggling? Why is she haggling?

00:13:22.230 --> 00:13:25.360
Looks like your Mama didn't know the price went up.

00:13:26.230 --> 00:13:28.120
Alright. Only for today, okay?

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:29.330
Yay!

00:13:29.330 --> 00:13:30.200
No way!

00:13:30.200 --> 00:13:32.290
Now I can go to grandma's.

00:13:33.030 --> 00:13:35.250
Eh? There's some money left.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:38.170
Lucky!

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:42.920
I've wasted not only my magic spheres, but also my allowance.

00:13:44.830 --> 00:13:49.180
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:13:49.180 --> 00:13:52.310
A cubical hamburger, appear!

00:13:56.950 --> 00:14:01.020
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:14:01.810 --> 00:14:04.780
A crescent rice omelet, appear!

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:13.580
You're both great. I'm sure you'll pass the exam.

00:14:13.580 --> 00:14:16.460
Forget that, why isn't Doremi here yet!?

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:20.000
She's the most important one. It won't work if she's not here!

00:14:21.620 --> 00:14:25.550
I can't take it anymore. When will it end?

00:14:25.550 --> 00:14:27.010
Baby-sitting Pop...

00:14:36.340 --> 00:14:38.270
Almost! Just one more task!

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.980
She only has to go straight to Grandma's.

00:14:53.910 --> 00:14:55.410
No way! She has to go to the bathroom!?

00:14:55.780 --> 00:14:58.750
It's because of the ice cream!

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:14.260
Good, she'll make it.

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:28.530
She didn't make it.

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:33.620
I'm alright. I won't cry.

00:15:39.250 --> 00:15:41.150
This is my last one.

00:15:41.150 --> 00:15:45.840
Remember to save some magic spheres for the exam.

00:15:46.370 --> 00:15:50.020
I may not be able to take the exam if I use my last one.

00:15:50.020 --> 00:15:51.300
But...

00:16:00.180 --> 00:16:03.020
Wash your panties... free?

00:16:17.780 --> 00:16:19.380
It's all fluffy.

00:16:19.380 --> 00:16:20.870
Let's go!

00:16:22.660 --> 00:16:24.420
Good luck, Pop!

00:16:28.670 --> 00:16:31.610
The trip was easy.

00:16:31.610 --> 00:16:33.170
I heard you went alone.

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:34.430
That's great.

00:16:34.430 --> 00:16:36.110
Yep, of course!

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:38.890
My, my, if only you knew you weren't alone.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.390
You did great, Pop.

00:16:42.930 --> 00:16:44.270
Mom!

00:16:45.510 --> 00:16:49.230
But now what am I supposed to do about the exam?

00:16:55.440 --> 00:16:58.600
I see you've used a lot of magic spheres.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:03.100
So you practiced by yourself. I shouldn't have worried so much.

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:04.790
Well, actually...

00:17:05.620 --> 00:17:06.210
What is it?

00:17:06.790 --> 00:17:08.670
I used all of them.

00:17:08.670 --> 00:17:13.210
What!? Didn't I tell you to use them carefully!?

00:17:13.210 --> 00:17:17.510
You can't take the exam like that! There's really none left!?

00:17:17.510 --> 00:17:18.640
Yeah, not even one.

00:17:19.330 --> 00:17:20.390
Got one!

00:17:21.010 --> 00:17:23.730
Ah, you had me so worried.

00:17:24.350 --> 00:17:25.450
Lucky.

00:17:25.450 --> 00:17:28.360
Perhaps I'm world's luckiest pretty girl.

00:17:28.360 --> 00:17:31.980
With this magic sphere, passing the exam will be a piece of cake!

00:17:31.980 --> 00:17:34.110
Well, now it'll go perfectly.

00:17:34.110 --> 00:17:38.410
Right, right! Majo Rika, don't you worry about me!

00:17:40.480 --> 00:17:43.120
Let's depart to the Witch World.

00:17:43.120 --> 00:17:46.160
We just go through this door?

00:17:46.160 --> 00:17:48.130
It'll be alright.

00:17:55.190 --> 00:17:56.800
Hurry up and open it!

00:18:11.590 --> 00:18:14.000
T-This is the Witch World?

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:15.420
Get going!

00:18:27.870 --> 00:18:29.540
The exam hall is this way.

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:33.880
Looks like a booth to me.

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:35.880
This is the examiner Mota.

00:18:35.880 --> 00:18:37.630
Welcome...

00:18:37.630 --> 00:18:38.930
And Motamota.

00:18:42.140 --> 00:18:43.500
Motamota!

00:18:52.010 --> 00:18:53.900
Welcome.

00:18:53.900 --> 00:18:56.360
She's definitely slow.

00:18:56.360 --> 00:18:59.490
Shall we begin then?

00:18:59.490 --> 00:19:01.320
We shall.

00:19:01.320 --> 00:19:04.330
There's no tension at all.

00:19:06.250 --> 00:19:10.020
This is for level 8, so... Uhm...

00:19:10.020 --> 00:19:11.200
Ah! Here, here!

00:19:11.200 --> 00:19:13.060
Oh? This one?

00:19:13.060 --> 00:19:14.540
Hey, hurry it up!

00:19:14.540 --> 00:19:18.260
Well... make a...

00:19:18.260 --> 00:19:19.380
Make a...

00:19:19.380 --> 00:19:20.160
Make a what?

00:19:20.160 --> 00:19:22.220
Well... cubical...

00:19:22.220 --> 00:19:23.970
Takoyaki!

00:19:24.940 --> 00:19:26.850
My practice pays off!

00:19:27.390 --> 00:19:32.350
Pameruku Laruku Larilori Poppun!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:35.020
Cubical takoyaki, appear!

00:19:41.430 --> 00:19:43.300
It's delicious.

00:19:43.300 --> 00:19:44.640
You pass.

00:19:44.640 --> 00:19:45.740
Alright!

00:19:45.740 --> 00:19:49.200
Next... three-layered...

00:19:49.200 --> 00:19:50.750
Pudding!

00:19:50.750 --> 00:19:52.250
Ah, sure.

00:19:53.030 --> 00:19:57.710
Paipai Ponpoi Puwapuwa Puu!

00:19:57.710 --> 00:20:00.720
Three-layered pudding, appear!

00:20:04.460 --> 00:20:06.020
It's delicious.

00:20:06.020 --> 00:20:07.180
You pass.

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:09.140
That's good.

00:20:09.140 --> 00:20:11.770
Then Doremi is the only one left.

00:20:11.770 --> 00:20:14.600
Then... the most delicious...

00:20:14.600 --> 00:20:16.110
Milk!

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:17.940
Just milk?

00:20:18.600 --> 00:20:19.900
Anmitsu...

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.360
Not done yet?

00:20:21.360 --> 00:20:22.860
Coffee...

00:20:22.860 --> 00:20:26.320
Milk, anmitsu, coffee? What's that?

00:20:26.320 --> 00:20:29.790
Shut up! Don't complain! Just do it!

00:20:29.790 --> 00:20:31.340
Alright.

00:20:31.340 --> 00:20:34.550
The most delicious... The most delicious...

00:20:34.550 --> 00:20:35.580
Here we go...

00:20:36.870 --> 00:20:40.570
Pirika Pirilala Poporina Peperuto!

00:20:40.570 --> 00:20:41.960
Appear!

00:20:44.560 --> 00:20:46.720
That's my most delicious food...

00:20:46.720 --> 00:20:49.180
So that's why a steak appeared.

00:20:51.990 --> 00:20:53.360
It's delicious.

00:20:53.360 --> 00:20:55.310
But, you don't pass.

00:20:55.310 --> 00:20:56.260
Come on!

00:20:58.800 --> 00:21:01.170
It's your fault.

00:21:02.100 --> 00:21:06.180
It's been hundreds of years since anyone failed the level 9 exam.

00:21:06.180 --> 00:21:07.550
Doremi-chan...

00:21:08.160 --> 00:21:11.490
Good job, you two.

00:21:11.490 --> 00:21:12.670
Take these.

00:21:12.670 --> 00:21:14.020
What're these?

00:21:18.980 --> 00:21:20.630
Ahh. A fairy?

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:28.600
I see. You're Mimi.

00:21:30.960 --> 00:21:32.770
You're Rere, right?

00:21:35.310 --> 00:21:37.060
Nice to meet you, Rere.

00:21:39.020 --> 00:21:40.480
Great to meetcha, Mimi.

00:21:43.200 --> 00:21:45.290
I envy you two...

00:21:45.290 --> 00:21:48.510
Why am I the only one who failed?

00:21:48.510 --> 00:21:51.060
How could this happen?

00:21:51.060 --> 00:21:51.980
Geez!

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:56.810
I really am the world's unluckiest pretty girl!

00:22:01.080 --> 00:22:04.150
I'm Doremi, the one who failed the level 9 exam.

00:22:04.150 --> 00:22:07.420
They said I can try again, so I'm in the Witch World again.

00:22:07.420 --> 00:22:09.800
Whoa, there's takoyaki in the Witch World too!

00:22:09.800 --> 00:22:12.160
Doremi-chan is famous in the Witch World, isn't she?

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:13.360
Eh, why?

00:22:13.360 --> 00:22:16.460
It's been hundreds of years since anyone failed the level 9 exam.

00:22:16.460 --> 00:22:17.620
I'm shocked.

00:22:17.620 --> 00:22:22.150
Relax, we'll go with you. The level 9 exam is the easiest of them all.

00:22:22.650 --> 00:22:23.680
Ojamajo Doremi!

00:22:23.680 --> 00:22:25.240
Go to the Witch World!!

00:22:26.110 --> 00:22:28.560
Happy! Lucky! For all of you!
